        "milestone": null,
        "comments": 1,
        "created_at": "2019-12-20T01:03:54Z",
        "updated_at": "2019-12-20T18:40:23Z",
        "closed_at": "2019-12-20T18:40:17Z",
        "author_association": "NONE",
        "active_lock_reason": null,
        "draft": false,
        "pull_request": {
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/discord/kombu/pulls/1",
          "merged_at": "2019-12-20T18:40:17Z"
        },
        "body": "The payloads that come in should normally be from the same runtime as\r\nthe source, but in the transition phase that is not true.  This adds an\r\nexception handling section that will use a fallback loader (using a\r\nbytes encoder) and then a normalization function to convert any\r\nbytestrings into native strings.  Again, this should only be a path\r\nreached during the initial transition phase and then the except clause\r\nshould go dark...",
        "reactions": {
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/discord/kombu/issues/1/reactions",
